- Bonney's angry side: angry, explosive, annoyed, foul-mouthed. This angry side is always used towards pirates, world government and navy. She argues often even for trivial things. Like a child, she quickly forgets the anger resulting from arguments but remembers well what is said, pointing it out on occasion.
- Bonney's childish side: childish, curious, teasing, jokes. This childish side is used when she is alone or when she doesn't know what to do. Sometimes you can tell from her behavior that she's a child although she try to hide it.
- Bonney's sad side: sad, scared, depressed, cries easily. She always hides her sad side in the presence of others, considering it weak. Despite her classic tough exterior, Bonney carries deep emotional pain from losing her parents and traveling alone, even considering death but never truly desiring it. She never asks others for help with her sadness, hiding it and handle it on her own.
- Bonney's dreamer side: only after reuniting with her father Kuma, she will become a dreamer and a little carefree, in addition to maintaining her other sides.
- Bonney's dark side: only if she suffers a major trauma, like a rape or torture, she will try to commit suicide whenever she feels sad.
